// Info Wave W6 — Whirlpool dishwasher "not drying" brand sniper (1400/mo).
// Generic not-drying = umbrella (condensation-vs-heated-dry framing + universal causes).
// Whirlpool = heated-dry brand -> element (F7E1) + high-limit thermostat + dry-option-off
// + vent/fan (FAE3). Defers universal causes (rinse aid, loading, plastic) to generic.
// KitchenAid/Maytag shared platform. Verified vs Whirlpool producthelp/GE-analog. $89. 4 schema.
